:: StoryTitle
Speedreader SugarCube Runtime Spike

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "8DB7D882-19FD-4E26-B392-5AFAB8DB41FD",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Start"
}

:: StoryScript [script]
window.spikeStoryScriptRan = true;
window.__speedreaderSpikeEvents = window.__speedreaderSpikeEvents || [];
window.__speedreaderSpikeErrors = window.__speedreaderSpikeErrors || [];
if (!window.__speedreaderSugarCubeListenerInstalled) {
  window.__speedreaderSugarCubeListenerInstalled = true;
  const eventTypes = [":storyready", ":passageinit", ":passagestart", ":passagerender", ":passagedisplay", ":passageend", ":historyupdate", ":typingstart", ":typingcomplete"];
  jQuery(document).on(eventTypes.join(" "), (event) => {
    const detail = event.detail || {};
    const passageObject = detail.passage || event.passage;
    const passage = passageObject && (passageObject.name || passageObject.title);
    window.__speedreaderSpikeEvents.push({ type: event.type, at: performance.now(), passage });
  });
}
Macro.add("spikebadge", {
  handler() {
    const badge = document.createElement("strong");
    badge.className = "spike-badge";
    badge.textContent = `[custom macro: ${this.args[0] ?? "ready"}]`;
    this.output.append(badge);
  },
});

:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
.spike-badge { font-weight: bold; }
.delayed { color: rebeccapurple; }

:: StoryInit
<<set $name to "Reader", $score to 0, $visits to 0, $agreed to false, $route to "north", $mood to "calm">>

:: Widgets [widget]
<<widget "spikewidget">>
<span class="spike-widget">Widget says: <<= _args[0]>></span>
<</widget>>

:: Start
<<set $visits += 1>>
Welcome to the runtime spike. <<spikebadge "running">>

This visit count is $visits. Choose a path.

[[Take the forest path->Forest][$score += 2]]

[[Take the river path->River][$score += 1]]

:: Forest
You entered the forest with a score of <<= $score>>.

<<if $score >= 2>>The setter link ran before navigation.<<else>>The setter link did not run.<</if>>

<<spikewidget "forest bridge active">>

[[Open the controls->Controls]]

:: River
You followed the river with a score of <<= $score>>.

<<if $score is 1>>The river condition evaluated correctly.<<else>>The river condition failed.<</if>>

[[Open the controls->Controls]]

:: Controls
Enter a name: <<textbox "$name" "Reader">>

Accept the expedition: <<checkbox "$agreed" false true>>

Choose a route:
<<radiobutton "$route" "north" checked>> North
<<radiobutton "$route" "south">> South

Choose a mood:
<<listbox "$mood" autoselect>>
  <<option "Calm" "calm">>
  <<option "Curious" "curious">>
  <<option "Bold" "bold">>
<</listbox>>

[[Continue to DOM mutations->Mutations]]

:: Mutations
Hello, $name. Agreement is <<= $agreed>>, route is <<= $route>>, and mood is <<= $mood>>.

<<linkappend "Reveal appended prose">> Newly appended words appeared.<</linkappend>>

<<linkreplace "Replace this control">> Replacement words appeared.<</linkreplace>>

<<cycle "$mood" autoselect>>
  <<option "Calm" "calm">>
  <<option "Curious" "curious">>
  <<option "Bold" "bold">>
<</cycle>>

<<timed 100ms>><span class="delayed">Delayed words appeared.</span><</timed>>

[[Revisit the beginning->Start]]

[[Finish the spike->End]]

:: End
The runtime spike reached its ending. Final score: <<= $score>>. Total Start visits: <<= $visits>>.
